+	  Enable temperature and voltage monitoring through the Processor
+	  Monitor Bus on Broadcom BCM6846. The PMB MFD driver provides
+	  register access. With THERMAL_OF enabled, the temperature channel
+	  also supplies the thermal zones described in the device tree.
+
+	  This driver can also be built as a module called bcm_pmb_pvtmon.
+
